  "notes": "Ichidan verb ({一段動詞|いちだんどうし}).\n- Negative: {抑|おさ}えない\n- Polite: {抑|おさ}えます\n- Te-form: {抑|おさ}えて\n- Past: {抑|おさ}えた\n- Potential: {抑|おさ}えられる\n\nCOMPARISON WITH {押|お}さえる:\n{抑|おさ}える and {押|お}さえる share the reading おさえる but use different kanji and have different core meanings:\n- {抑|おさ}える: to suppress, restrain, or limit (emotions, costs, spread)\n- {押|お}さえる: to press down, hold in place, or secure physically\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {感情|かんじょう}を{抑|おさ}える: to restrain one's emotions\n- {怒|いか}りを{抑|おさ}える: to suppress anger\n- {涙|なみだ}を{抑|おさ}える: to hold back tears\n- {費用|ひよう}を{抑|おさ}える: to keep costs down\n- {症状|しょうじょう}を{抑|おさ}える: to control symptoms",
